reads `pages_free_direct` out of bounds for sizes over `MI_SMALL_SIZE_MAX` (1024 bytes). A
constructor crosses that at 128 object fields, far below the 256 that `LEAN_MAX_CTOR_FIELDS` allows.
Allocate many wide constructors and read them back, so that a wrong-size-class block corrupts the
heap rather than escaping notice.
-/

